WEBVTT

00:00.543 --> 00:01.524
The world was burning

00:29.464 --> 00:35.007
The lies were loud. We were the joking tabloid

00:35.067 --> 00:35.567
crowd.

00:39.049 --> 00:45.332
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.392 --> 00:51.374
road and a telephone. But you.

00:54.438 --> 01:00.183
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.263 --> 01:03.765
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

01:03.805 --> 01:10.150
storm. You are the iron hand. You are the shield.

01:10.250 --> 01:16.735
The only army that would not yield. This is our

01:18.056 --> 01:20.959
fortress.

01:24.093 --> 01:31.038
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.098 --> 01:37.662
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.702 --> 01:43.886
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.266 --> 01:48.969
our hallowed ground. God is you.

01:52.038 --> 01:57.781
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.861 --> 02:01.362
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.402 --> 02:07.765
storm. You are the iron heads. You are the

02:07.845 --> 02:13.748
shield. The only army that would not yield. This

02:13.828 --> 02:17.289
is our fortress.

02:52.613 --> 02:54.334
Our fortress,

02:55.854 --> 02:59.275
our home

02:59.295 --> 03:04.056
We are the fortress

